{
 "name": "Website to contacts: enrich a lead list in Google Sheets",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "about-this-workflow",
   "name": "About this workflow",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -640,
    60
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Website to contacts: enrich a lead list\n\nTurn a list of company websites into contact details, every day, in the same Google Sheet.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Every day** starts the run each morning.\n2. **Read leads** reads your sheet; **Only new leads** skips rows already processed.\n3. **Find contacts** (CompassLab, Company Contact) reads the company's homepage and contact and legal pages and returns the business email, phone, LinkedIn page, legal name and VAT ID it publishes. Only business contacts, never personal emails; robots.txt is respected.\n4. **Write the contacts** writes the details and a status (for example when a site publishes nothing or blocks bots) into the row.\n\n### Set up steps (5 minutes)\n1. Your sheet needs a `website` column (a domain or URL). Add the columns `company`, `email`, `phone`, `linkedin`, `vat_id`, `contacts_status`.\n2. Select your sheet in **Read leads** and **Write the contacts**.\n3. In **Find contacts**, create a CompassLab credential with your api.market or RapidAPI key (both have a free plan).",
    "width": 560,
    "height": 640,
    "color": "6"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "every-day",
   "name": "Every day",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1.2,
   "position": [
    0,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "rule": {
     "interval": [
      {
       "triggerAtHour": 8
      }
     ]
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "read-leads",
   "name": "Read leads",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
   "typeVersion": 2,
   "position": [
    220,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "jsCode": "return [{\"json\": {\"website\": \"python.org\"}}, {\"json\": {\"website\": \"n8n.io\"}}, {\"json\": {\"website\": \"done.example\", \"contacts_status\": \"ok\"}}];"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "only-new-leads",
   "name": "Only new leads",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
   "typeVersion": 2.2,
   "position": [
    440,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "conditions": {
     "options": {
      "caseSensitive": true,
      "leftValue": "",
      "typeValidation": "loose",
      "version": 2
     },
     "conditions": [
      {
       "id": "1",
       "leftValue": "={{ $json.website }}",
       "rightValue": "",
       "operator": {
        "type": "string",
        "operation": "notEmpty",
        "singleValue": true
       }
      },
      {
       "id": "2",
       "leftValue": "={{ $json.contacts_status }}",
       "rightValue": "",
       "operator": {
        "type": "string",
        "operation": "empty",
        "singleValue": true
       }
      }
     ],
     "combinator": "and"
    },
    "options": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "find-contacts",
   "name": "Find contacts",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-compasslab.compassLab",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    660,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "resource": "contact",
    "operation": "findContacts",
    "domain": "={{ $json.website }}"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "write-the-contacts",
   "name": "Write the contacts",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
   "typeVersion": 3.4,
   "position": [
    880,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "assignments": {
     "assignments": [
      {
       "id": "website",
       "name": "website",
       "value": "={{ $('Only new leads').item.json.website }}",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "id": "company",
       "name": "company",
       "value": "={{ $json.company?.legal_name || $json.company?.name || '' }}",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "id": "email",
       "name": "email",
       "value": "={{ $json.emails?.[0]?.value ?? '' }}",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "id": "phone",
       "name": "phone",
       "value": "={{ $json.phones?.[0]?.e164 ?? '' }}",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "id": "linkedin",
       "name": "linkedin",
       "value": "={{ $json.social_profiles?.find(p => p.network === 'linkedin')?.url ?? '' }}",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "id": "vat_id",
       "name": "vat_id",
       "value": "={{ $json.company?.vat_id ?? '' }}",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "id": "contacts_status",
       "name": "contacts_status",
       "value": "={{ $json.status }}",
       "type": "string"
      }
     ]
    },
    "options": {}
   }
  }
 ],
 "connections": {
  "Every day": {
   "main": [
    [
     {
      "node": "Read leads",
      "type": "main",
      "index": 0
     }
    ]
   ]
  },
  "Read leads": {
   "main": [
    [
     {
      "node": "Only new leads",
      "type": "main",
      "index": 0
     }
    ]
   ]
  },
  "Only new leads": {
   "main": [
    [
     {
      "node": "Find contacts",
      "type": "main",
      "index": 0
     }
    ]
   ]
  },
  "Find contacts": {
   "main": [
    [
     {
      "node": "Write the contacts",
      "type": "main",
      "index": 0
     }
    ]
   ]
  }
 },
 "settings": {
  "executionOrder": "v1"
 },
 "meta": {
  "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
  "description": "Finds the business email, phone, LinkedIn page, legal name and VAT ID that companies publish on their websites with the CompassLab node (Company Contact) and writes them into a Google Sheet."
 }
}
